          "text": "$f\\left(x\\right)=x^5+ax^4+bx^3$   \n$g\\left(x\\right)=x^5+sx^4+tx^3$   \nIn the polynomial functions *f* and *g* above, *a*, *b*, *s*, and *t* are constants. If the polynomial $h(x)=f(x)+g(x)$ is divisible by $x^4$  ,which of the following must be true ?"
